tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"data-structures-and-formats\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 8 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 8 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 8 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Data table, tagged record, document, image, audio ও log আকারে আসে। Structure storage, validation ও analytical preparation-এ কী প্রভাব ফেলে তা শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Data comes in tables, tagged records, documents, images, audio, and logs. Learn how structure affects storage, validation, and analytical preparation.\">Data comes in tables, tagged records, documents, images, audio, and logs. Learn how structure affects storage, validation, and analytical preparation.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 40 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Structured, semi-structured ও unstructured data আলাদা করুন।\" data-en=\"Distinguish structured, semi-structured, and unstructured data.\">Distinguish structured, semi-structured, and unstructured data.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Common file format চিনুন।\" data-en=\"Recognize common file formats.\">Recognize common file formats.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Schema কেন গুরুত্বপূর্ণ explain করুন।\" data-en=\"Explain why schema matters.\">Explain why schema matters.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Analytical task-এর জন্য usable format বেছে নিন।\" data-en=\"Choose a usable format for an analytical task.\">Choose a usable format for an analytical task.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Structured data\" data-en=\"Structured data\">Structured data</h2><p data-bn=\"Structured data explicit schema follow করে, সাধারণত defined field type-সহ row ও column। Relational table ও well-formed CSV common example। Structure filtering, joining, validation ও aggregation সহজ করে।\" data-en=\"Structured data follows an explicit schema, commonly rows and columns with defined field types. Relational tables and well-formed CSV files are typical examples. Structure makes filtering, joining, validation, and aggregation straightforward.\">Structured data follows an explicit schema, commonly rows and columns with defined field types. Relational tables and well-formed CSV files are typical examples. Structure makes filtering, joining, validation, and aggregation straightforward.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Semi-structured data\" data-en=\"Semi-structured data\">Semi-structured data</h2><p data-bn=\"Semi-structured data-এ label বা nested organization থাকে, কিন্তু fixed rectangular table প্রয়োজন নেই। JSON, XML, application event ও API response example। Tabular analysis-এর আগে nested field flatten বা repeated record extract করা হয়।\" data-en=\"Semi-structured data contains labels or nested organization but does not require a fixed rectangular table. JSON, XML, application events, and many API responses are examples. Analysts often flatten nested fields or extract repeated records before tabular analysis.\">Semi-structured data contains labels or nested organization but does not require a fixed rectangular table. JSON, XML, application events, and many API responses are examples. Analysts often flatten nested fields or extract repeated records before tabular analysis.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Unstructured data\" data-en=\"Unstructured data\">Unstructured data</h2><p data-bn=\"Document, free text, image, audio ও video predefined analytical column হিসেবে আসে না। Information থাকলেও standard analysis-এর আগে coding, text processing, annotation, image analysis বা metadata extraction প্রয়োজন।\" data-en=\"Documents, free text, images, audio, and video do not arrive as predefined analytical columns. They still contain information, but require coding, text processing, annotation, image analysis, or metadata extraction before many standard analyses.\">Documents, free text, images, audio, and video do not arrive as predefined analytical columns. They still contain information, but require coding, text processing, annotation, image analysis, or metadata extraction before many standard analyses.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-4\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">04</div><h2 data-bn=\"Format ও meaning এক নয়\" data-en=\"Formats are not the same as meaning\">Formats are not the same as meaning</h2><p data-bn=\"CSV storage describe করে, data quality বা meaning নয়। CSV-তেও mixed observation, invalid date বা missing definition থাকতে পারে। JSON highly regular হতে পারে। File extension নয়, schema, semantics ও provenance inspect করুন।\" data-en=\"CSV describes storage, not the quality or meaning of the data. A CSV can still mix observations, contain invalid dates, or omit definitions. JSON can be highly regular. Always inspect schema, semantics, and provenance—not only the file extension.\">CSV describes storage, not the quality or meaning of the data. A CSV can still mix observations, contain invalid dates, or omit definitions. JSON can be highly regular. Always inspect schema, semantics, and provenance—not only the file extension.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Schema\" data-en=\"Schema\">Schema</h3><p data-bn=\"Field, type, constraint ও relationship describe করা rule।\" data-en=\"Rules describing fields, types, constraints, and relationships.\">Rules describing fields, types, constraints, and relationships.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"CSV\" data-en=\"CSV\">CSV</h3><p data-bn=\"Delimited tabular record-এর plain-text format।\" data-en=\"A plain-text format for delimited tabular records.\">A plain-text format for delimited tabular records.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"JSON\" data-en=\"JSON\">JSON</h3><p data-bn=\"Object, array ও nested key-value data-এর text format।\" data-en=\"A text format for objects, arrays, and nested key-value data.\">A text format for objects, arrays, and nested key-value data.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Metadata\" data-en=\"Metadata\">Metadata</h3><p data-bn=\"Data describe করা information, যেমন source, date, field meaning বা file property।\" data-en=\"Information describing data, such as source, date, field meaning, or file properties.\">Information describing data, such as source, date, field meaning, or file properties.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Website activity data\" data-en=\"Website activity data\">Website activity data</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"একটি organization-এর users table, JSON click event ও free-text support message আছে।\" data-en=\"An organization has a users table, JSON click events, and free-text support messages.\">An organization has a users table, JSON click events, and free-text support messages.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"Users table structured।\" data-en=\"The users table is structured.\">The users table is structured.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"Nested event record semi-structured।\" data-en=\"The nested event records are semi-structured.\">The nested event records are semi-structured.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"Support message body unstructured text।\" data-en=\"Support message bodies are unstructured text.\">Support message bodies are unstructured text.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Definition ও privacy rule permit করলে ID ও timestamp দিয়ে source connect করুন।\" data-en=\"Use IDs and timestamps to connect sources only when definitions and privacy rules permit.\">Use IDs and timestamps to connect sources only when definitions and privacy rules permit.</p></li><li><span>5</span><p data-bn=\"Analysis-এর আগে structure অনুযায়ী source transform করুন।\" data-en=\"Transform each source according to its structure before analysis.\">Transform each source according to its structure before analysis.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Different structure একই question support করতে পারে, কিন্তু preparation ও governance আলাদা।\" data-en=\"Different structures can support one question, but each requires different preparation and governance.\">Different structures can support one question, but each requires different preparation and governance.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Structured data explicit schema follow করে।\" data-en=\"Structured data follows an explicit schema.\">Structured data follows an explicit schema.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Semi-structured data-এ tag বা nested organization থাকে।\" data-en=\"Semi-structured data has tags or nested organization.\">Semi-structured data has tags or nested organization.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Unstructured data-তে additional extraction বা coding প্রয়োজন।\" data-en=\"Unstructured data requires additional extraction or coding.\">Unstructured data requires additional extraction or coding.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"File format quality guarantee করে না।\" data-en=\"File format does not guarantee quality.\">File format does not guarantee quality.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/SpecialPublications/1500-18/NIST.SP.1500-18r2.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST Research Data Framework ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://ukdataservice.ac.uk/help/new-users/data-documentation/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">UK Data Service — Data Documentation ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/measurement-scales/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Measurement Scale\" data-en=\"Measurement Scales\">Measurement Scales</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}